        <mxCell id="opn" value="OPNSENSE  ·  inter-VLAN firewall · Kea DHCP (authority) · Unbound DNS&#10;Squid on :3128, LOG-ONLY (6.4) — the nodes&#x27; proxy for apt and image pulls&#10;no inbound port-forwards (external scan 2026-10-27: all filtered)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;arcSize=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
