        <mxCell id="plat" value="PLATFORM&#10;cilium: CNI, kube-proxy replacement, WireGuard,&#10;   Gateway API on .241 (MetalLB), Hubble&#10;cert-manager · kubelet-csr-approver&#10;longhorn: replicated volumes, S3 backups&#10;argo cd: reconciles everything from git&#10;ARC: lab-deploy + lab-dind runner scale sets" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;arcSize=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
