        <mxCell id="note" value="Everything above is declared in nineteenseventytwo-platform and reconciled&#10;by Argo CD; app repos publish images and own nothing cluster-side (ADR-0012).&#10;Rebuild path: docs/REBUILD.md. Detail per layer: argocd.drawio,&#10;access-controls.drawio, security-awareness.drawio, shift-left.drawio." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=10;arcSize=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
